Day 1 
1.	If working with Ibidi Chambers, prepare a humid chamber by placing Whattmann paper inside a large Petri dish, wet the paper and place parafilm on it. If working with adherent cells, this step is not necessary.
2.	For neurons: Treat with DNase I/RNase first
3.	Wash cells once with 1X PBS at room temperature (RT). – for neurons don’t do this
Use 500 ul volume per 24well when working with coverslips inside the 24well and use P1000 for neurons (no vacuum)
For other cells can use serological pipettes
For neurons: prepare 8%PFA and mix 1:1 with media in the well. Use fresh PFA always for neurons.
4.	Fix cells for 15 minutes with cold 4% PFA in 1X PBS at RT inside a chemical cabinet.
5.	Wash twice for 5min with 1X PBS at RT.
6.	Add the Triton Permeabilization Solution and incubate for 30min at RT. Do not incubate for more than 30min!
7.	Wash three times for 5min with 1X PBS at RT.
8.	Dilute the primary antibody/antibodies in Blocking Solution. Incubate the primary antibodies ON at 4°C (in the fridge, standing)
Combine antibodies according to host species. Prepare one tube per combination of antibodies. 

Day 2 (all steps are performed in the dark and/or using aluminum foil as cover)

1.	Wash three times for 5min with 1X PBS at RT.
For neurons first wash with PBS with 0.1% Triton
2.	Dilute the secondary antibody/antibodies in Blocking Solution. Incubate the secondary antibodies for 2h at RT, protected from light.
For neurons add DAPI at this point 1:1000.
3.	Wash three times for 5min with 1X PBS at RT.
For neurons first wash with PBS with 0.1% Triton
4.	For other cells: Dilute DAPI 1:5.000 in 1X PBS, and incubate 10min at RT.
5.	Wash once for 5min with 1X PBS at RT.
6.	Final mounting:

For standard IF, you can dilute prolong glass 1:2 into ultrapure H2O.For neurons do not dilute the mounting media. 

a.	Coverslips/Ibidi Chambers: Remove excess PBS using tissue paper or Whattmann paper. Add enough Prolong Glass/equivalent over the cells and carefully place the coverslip over the cells.

b.	Adherent cells inside wells: Add fresh 1X PBS and store at 4°C.
